{"id":"55e5037ed821c800","group":"16","path":"16/16-thm-set-p-topos.md","title":"thm-tripos-to-topos","display":"thm-tripos-to-topos","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-thm-set-p-topos","aliases":["16-thm-set-p-topos","16-thm--set-p-topos"],"display":"thm-tripos-to-topos","depends_on":["[[16-df-tripos]]","[[16-df-set-p]]","[[16-df-set-of-fibration]]","[[16-df-elementary-topos]]","[[16-df-split-higher-order-fibration]]"],"revision_date":"2026-10-20","source":"Proposition6.1.3 pp.377–378 (PDF397–398); Proposition6.1.6 pp.379–382 (PDF399–402); Corollary6.1.7 p.383 (PDF403)"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-thm-set-p-topos"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-thm-set-p-topos</span><span>16-thm--set-p-topos</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-tripos-to-topos"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0632c91c845f3662\" href=\"?note=0632c91c845f3662\" title=\"16-df-tripos\">16-df-tripos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3e07004160abc932\" href=\"?note=3e07004160abc932\" title=\"16-df-set-p\">16-df-set-p</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"58e47ffb16d63410\" href=\"?note=58e47ffb16d63410\" title=\"16-df-set-of-fibration\">16-df-set-of-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3744a99e6a5c0037\" href=\"?note=3744a99e6a5c0037\" title=\"16-df-elementary-topos\">16-df-elementary-topos</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"eeefa02192bbb359\" href=\"?note=eeefa02192bbb359\" title=\"16-df-split-higher-order-fibration\">16-df-split-higher-order-fibration</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"},{"key":"source","html":"Proposition6.1.3 pp.377–378 (PDF397–398); Proposition6.1.6 pp.379–382 (PDF399–402); Corollary6.1.7 p.383 (PDF403)"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal P\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\">\\(p:\\mathcal P\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\\)</span> 为正则纤维化，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Set}(p)\">\\(\\mathbf{Set}(p)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"58e47ffb16d63410\" href=\"?note=58e47ffb16d63410\" title=\"16-df-set-of-fibration\">16-df-set-of-fibration</a> 的关系商构造；下式检验普通或分裂 tripos 条件。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Set}(p)\">\\(\\mathbf{Set}(p)\\)</span> (其 PER/functional-relation 完备化)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tripos}\">\\(\\mathrm{Tripos}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SplitTripos}\">\\(\\mathrm{SplitTripos}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElemTopos}\">\\(\\mathrm{ElemTopos}\\)</span> 分别采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0632c91c845f3662\" href=\"?note=0632c91c845f3662\" title=\"16-df-tripos\">16-df-tripos</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"eeefa02192bbb359\" href=\"?note=eeefa02192bbb359\" title=\"16-df-split-higher-order-fibration\">16-df-split-higher-order-fibration</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"3744a99e6a5c0037\" href=\"?note=3744a99e6a5c0037\" title=\"16-df-elementary-topos\">16-df-elementary-topos</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}tripos\\text{-}to\\text{-}topos}\\vdash\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Tripos}(p)\\lor\\mathrm{SplitTripos}(p)\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{ElemTopos}(\\mathbf{Set}(p)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}tripos\\text{-}to\\text{-}topos}\\vdash\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Tripos}(p)\\lor\\mathrm{SplitTripos}(p)\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{ElemTopos}(\\mathbf{Set}(p)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>结论依赖 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"3e07004160abc932\" href=\"?note=3e07004160abc932\" title=\"16-df-set-p\">16-df-set-p</a> 的 PER 构造；若把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Set}(p)\">\\(\\mathbf{Set}(p)\\)</span> 误解为离散对象子范畴，该定理一般不成立。</li>\n<li>分裂分支使用其分裂泛对象提供的严格分类，从而也提供构造严格谓词泛对象所需的分类箭头。关系商已经以逻辑等价识别谓词；不需要额外要求原实现性纤维中的普通唯一同构分类。原书 §§5.3、6.1 的实现性例子属于这一分支。</li>\n<li>来源为Proposition6.1.3 pp.377–378（PDF397–398）、Proposition6.1.6 pp.379–382（PDF399–402）与Corollary6.1.7 p.383（PDF403）。已核对这些构造和推导链：终对象取终基对象与真等式，二元积取分量PER，等化子限制到两功能关系相等处，指数取全定义单值关系及逻辑等价。严格谓词的关系商逐纤维同构于子对象；真、联结词、量词与泛谓词在严格谓词中按6.1.6构造，从而子对象纤维化为高阶纤维化，依topos定义得到结论。原书若干关系式的逐项验证留读者；本页核对该来源证明链，未宣称独立逐项重建或机器核验全部辅助细节。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-tripos","status":"resolved","id":"0632c91c845f3662","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-tripos]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-set-p","status":"resolved","id":"3e07004160abc932","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-set-p]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-set-of-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"58e47ffb16d63410","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-set-of-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-elementary-topos","status":"resolved","id":"3744a99e6a5c0037","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-elementary-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-split-higher-order-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"eeefa02192bbb359","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-split-higher-order-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-set-of-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"58e47ffb16d63410","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal P\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$ 为正则纤维化，$\\mathbf{Set}(p)$ 采用 [[16-df-set-of-fibration]] 的关系商构造；下式检验普通或分裂 tripos 条件。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-tripos","status":"resolved","id":"0632c91c845f3662","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Tripos}$、$\\mathrm{SplitTripos}$、$\\mathrm{ElemTopos}$ 分别采用 [[16-df-tripos]]、[[16-df-split-higher-order-fibration]]、[[16-df-elementary-topos]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-split-higher-order-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"eeefa02192bbb359","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Tripos}$、$\\mathrm{SplitTripos}$、$\\mathrm{ElemTopos}$ 分别采用 [[16-df-tripos]]、[[16-df-split-higher-order-fibration]]、[[16-df-elementary-topos]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-elementary-topos","status":"resolved","id":"3744a99e6a5c0037","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Tripos}$、$\\mathrm{SplitTripos}$、$\\mathrm{ElemTopos}$ 分别采用 [[16-df-tripos]]、[[16-df-split-higher-order-fibration]]、[[16-df-elementary-topos]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-set-p","status":"resolved","id":"3e07004160abc932","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"结论依赖 [[16-df-set-p]] 的 PER 构造；若把 $\\mathbf{Set}(p)$ 误解为离散对象子范畴，该定理一般不成立。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p:\\mathcal P\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Set}(p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Set}(p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Tripos}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SplitTripos}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ElemTopos}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}tripos\\text{-}to\\text{-}topos}\\vdash\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Tripos}(p)\\lor\\mathrm{SplitTripos}(p)\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{ElemTopos}(\\mathbf{Set}(p)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Set}(p)","display":false}],"bytes":2317,"backlinks":[{"id":"b6311019c9acbb97","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SplitTripos}(r_{\\mathbb N})$ 由 [[16-df-realizability-connectives]] 的显式运算得到，因而满足该关系构造的正则性前提。$\\mathrm{ElemTopos}$ 及分裂 tripos 的成拓扑斯结论采用 [[16-thm-set-p-topos]]。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-450","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-thm-set-p-topos|thm-tripos-to-topos]]"}],"outgoing":["0632c91c845f3662","3e07004160abc932","58e47ffb16d63410","3744a99e6a5c0037","eeefa02192bbb359"]}